# Route 13 (the longest road in Unova, along cliffs and the sea): a steady walking flute tune in A minor over strings, a guitar
# arpeggio that keeps the pace, a bass on the beat and a light drum, a road with no end in sight and no hurry. At night a clarinet
# takes the tune, slower. Original composition for this game (plan 22 · U7, part b).
